    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717160/extras/c24a6d86791f265d5d4fab0d3ee5f282.poster.avif?t=1705735395\" width=499 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717160/extras/c24a6d86791f265d5d4fab0d3ee5f282.webm?t=1705735395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>.<br><br>Spawning as a lonely abandoned spider egg you need to build your web across the universe and start your home. Watch out though, your neighbors are just as territorial so you'll need to use the time you have to fight back. <br><br>Webcraft's core mechanic is similar to the arcade claw machine game where you have to aim, shoot and hope you successfully grab what you're after. Use your rewards to craft items, build your base and grow a farm to survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Use your claw machine skills to catch flying resources</strong> and keep an eye out for rare resources.<br></li><li><strong>Build a farm to feed yourself </strong> and maybe even make money by trading your harvest.<br></li><li><strong>Craft turrets, factories and other buildings </strong>to strengthen your base's output and defense.<br></li><li><strong>Explore the solar system and attack local wildlife</strong> to steal their treasure.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717160/extras/6b8714475080ef3200e6e75b0ab15bdd.poster.avif?t=1705735395\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717160/extras/6b8714475080ef3200e6e75b0ab15bdd.webm?t=1705735395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717160/extras/6b8714475080ef3200e6e75b0ab15bdd.mp4?t=1705735395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><br>Big thanks to all the support from everyone for getting the game this far!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717160/extras/c24a6d86791f265d5d4fab0d3ee5f282.poster.avif?t=1705735395\" width=499 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717160/extras/c24a6d86791f265d5d4fab0d3ee5f282.webm?t=1705735395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>.<br><br>Spawning as a lonely abandoned spider egg you need to build your web across the universe and start your home. Watch out though, your neighbors are just as territorial so you'll need to use the time you have to fight back. <br><br>Webcraft's core mechanic is similar to the arcade claw machine game where you have to aim, shoot and hope you successfully grab what you're after. Use your rewards to craft items, build your base and grow a farm to survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Use your claw machine skills to catch flying resources</strong> and keep an eye out for rare resources.<br></li><li><strong>Build a farm to feed yourself </strong> and maybe even make money by trading your harvest.<br></li><li><strong>Craft turrets, factories and other buildings </strong>to strengthen your base's output and defense.<br></li><li><strong>Explore the solar system and attack local wildlife</strong> to steal their treasure.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717160/extras/6b8714475080ef3200e6e75b0ab15bdd.poster.avif?t=1705735395\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717160/extras/6b8714475080ef3200e6e75b0ab15bdd.webm?t=1705735395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717160/extras/6b8714475080ef3200e6e75b0ab15bdd.mp4?t=1705735395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><br>Big thanks to all the support from everyone for getting the game this far!",
